@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Camera Frame" as Frame
rectangle "Pose / Movement Telemetry" as Telemetry
rectangle "Rep Metrics" as Metrics
rectangle "Form Events + Rule Evidence" as Events
rectangle "Tracking Events" as Tracking
rectangle "Health Context Cache" as Health
rectangle "Debug Video\n(opt-in only)" as Video
rectangle "Room / SQLite" as Room
rectangle "Local File Storage" as Files

Frame --> Telemetry : infer pose
Frame --> Video : only in explicit debug mode
Frame --> Frame : discard after processing
Telemetry --> Room : short/medium retention
Metrics --> Room : long-term
Events --> Room : long-term
Tracking --> Room : long-term / bounded
Health --> Room : normalized local cache
Video --> Files : explicit opt-in

note right of Telemetry
Telemetry retention must be bounded.
Prefer configurable downsampling / compaction
instead of unlimited per-frame growth.
end note

note right of Metrics
Keep durable derived metrics because they are tiny
and useful for longitudinal trend analysis.
end note

note right of Events
Persist rule id/version and exact evidence
so decisions remain explainable and replayable.
end note

note right of Video
Never save by default.
Never upload automatically.
Use only when debugging a detector/rule failure.
end note

note bottom of Room
Personal data stays on-device.
Exports/backups, if ever added, must be explicit user actions.
end note

@enduml
